      "text": "The training results on Pick-a-Pic v2 dataset are reported in Table 2. In most cases, ArenaPO achieves\nthe best overall performance across different datasets and backbones. On Pick-a-Pic v2 benchmark\nwith Stable Diffusion 1.5, ArenaPO outperforms all baselines on all five metrics, improving PickScore\nfrom 0.2143 (SDPO) to 0.2151 and ImageReward from 0.5546 to 0.6063. Moreover, Figure 4 presents\nthe win-rate results, and ArenaPO consistently demonstrates an advantage.\n",
